# .vercelignore — what must NOT be uploaded to Vercel
# ============================================================================
# Vercel treats every .js file under `api/` as a Serverless Function. Tests and
# helpers now live in `server/`, so these rules are defensive only: a future
# co-located test must never become a deployable route or consume the Hobby
# plan's 12-function budget.
api/**/*.test.js
api/**/testHelpers.js
